// misconceptions a child of eight really shows, and a teaching pack entry. Practical outcomes (hygiene in the sleeping area,
// table manners, soil and heat conservation, cleaning and saving water, a kitchen garden, caring for animals, managing waste)
// are marked by the teacher with the KICD rubric. Merged by scripts/build-environmental-grade.mjs 3. Draft until reviewed.
