  'NATURA.WEATHER': 'Lightning and floods are real dangers in many parts of Kenya: teach the safe action first (SAFE).',
  'RESOUR.PLANTS': 'Children never taste an unknown plant, berry or mushroom, even to test it (SAFE).',
